menu "C5VRX-5 experiments (bench only)"

    config C5VRX5_EXPERIMENT_U85_CVT
        bool "U85-CVT bench tracker (console V)"
        default n
        help
            Builds the experimental immutable U85-CVT LUT on the U85Q and
            U85Q-LP instruction schedules (v5/research/u85_cvt.py,
            CVT_STATUS.md). Console V switches to it and back through the
            verified pipeline restart and saves AUTO OFF. The held-out
            validation is negative against the MATCHED baseline: keep OFF
            for production and flight builds.

    config C5VRX5_EXPERIMENT_SPHASE_NORMALIZED
        bool "Sampling phase: normalized HF gate"
        default n
        help
            Qualifies the sampling phase on the fourth-difference energy
            normalized by the second-difference energy of the same windows
            instead of the absolute limit. Phasefix6 settled at boot but
            failed subsequent explicit scans on the board; production keeps
            the absolute gate.

endmenu
